248CM6cG 1986Cz02 report values for the g.s. band. Some values of 1993Pi07      
248CM7cG are quoted with uncertainties of 0.1 keV; however, except for the      
248CM8cG 495.8|g from the 26+ level, where the energies are the same, the       
248CM9cG values from 1993Pi07 are all lower than those of 2002AbZV by           
248CMAcG 0.5 to 0.9 keV. For consistency among the several bands, values        
248CMBcG from 2002AbZV are adopted here and in adopted gammas.                  
