248FM5c  GREAT spectrometer at the focal plane of the gas-filled                
248FM6c  recoil-separator RITU. Identified isomer from summed energies of       
248FM7c  electrons in highly converted transitions using the DSSSD. Measured    
248FM8c  recoil-gated |g-ray singles, |a tagged |g-ray singles half-life of     
248FM9c  isomer. Comparison of rotational band with theoretical calculations    
